msgid ""
"昇腾在 `quay.io/ascend/verl <https://quay.io/repository/ascend/verl?tab=tags&tag=latest>`_ 中托管每日构建的 A2/A3/950 镜像，基于 `Dockerfile <../../../../docker/ascend>`_ 构建。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Ascend hosts the daily-built A2/A3/950 images in `quay.io/ascend/verl <https://quay.io/repository/ascend/verl?tab=tags&tag=latest>`_, built from the `Dockerfile <../../../../docker/ascend>`_.\n"
""

msgid ""
"最新构建镜像名格式：latest-{推理后端}-{适用产品信息}-{操作系统}-{其他字段}\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Latest built image name format: latest-{inference backend}-{applicable product information}-{operating system}-{other fields}\n"
""

msgid ""
"verl release版本镜像名格式：{verl release版本号}-{CANN版本}-{TorchNPU版本}[-{适用产品信息}-{操作系统}]-{Python版本}[-{推理后端}-{其他字段}]\n"
""
msgstr ""
"The verl release image name format is: {verl release version}-{CANN version}-{TorchNPU version}[-{applicable product information}-{operating system}]-{Python version}[-{inference backend}-{other fields}]\n"
""

msgid ""
"verl v0.9.1 的 vLLM 镜像使用 CANN 9.1.0、Python 3.12 和 vLLM 0.23.0，支持 ``linux/amd64`` 和 ``linux/arm64``。对应镜像名如下：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"The vLLM image for verl v0.9.1 uses CANN 9.1.0, Python 3.12, and vLLM 0.23.0, and supports ``linux/amd64`` and ``linux/arm64``. The corresponding image names are as follows:\n"
""

msgid ""
"* A2：``quay.io/ascend/verl:v0.9.1-cann9.1.0-torch_npu2.10.0.post4-910b-ubuntu22.04-py3.12-vllm``\n"
"* A3：``quay.io/ascend/verl:v0.9.1-cann9.1.0-torch_npu2.10.0.post4-a3-ubuntu22.04-py3.12-vllm``\n"
"* Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品：``quay.io/ascend/verl:v0.9.1-cann9.1.0-torch_npu2.10.0.post4-950-ubuntu22.04-py3.12-vllm``\n"
""
msgstr ""
"* A2: ``quay.io/ascend/verl:v0.9.1-cann9.1.0-torch_npu2.10.0.post4-910b-ubuntu22.04-py3.12-vllm``\n"
"* A3: ``quay.io/ascend/verl:v0.9.1-cann9.1.0-torch_npu2.10.0.post4-a3-ubuntu22.04-py3.12-vllm``\n"
"* Ascend 950PR&950DT series products: ``quay.io/ascend/verl:v0.9.1-cann9.1.0-torch_npu2.10.0.post4-950-ubuntu22.04-py3.12-vllm``\n"
""

