msgid ""
"当前 A2/A3 Megatron 环境以 ``scripts/install_vllm_mcore_npu.sh`` 为基准：\n"
"Megatron-LM、MindSpeed、MegatronAdaptor 使用 ``core_r0.18.0``，\n"
"Megatron-Bridge 使用 ``v0.5.0``；MindSpeed-Bridge 使用仓库默认分支（未固定 tag/commit），\n"
"同时安装 TransformerEngineNPU 和 MindSpeed-Ops。SGLang CI 镜像需要重建后才能使用该组合。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"The current A2/A3 Megatron environment uses ``scripts/install_vllm_mcore_npu.sh`` as the baseline: Megatron-LM, MindSpeed, and MegatronAdaptor use ``core_r0.18.0``, and Megatron-Bridge uses ``v0.5.0``. MindSpeed-Bridge uses the default repository branch (without a fixed tag or commit), and TransformerEngineNPU and MindSpeed-Ops are also installed. You must rebuild the SGLang CI image before you can use this combination.\n"
""

