msgid ""
"**说明：**\n"
""
msgstr ""
"**Description:**\n"
""

msgid ""
"* 推理后端为 ``vLLM`` 镜像中，vLLM、vLLM-ascend、MindSpeed、Megatron-LM、verl 为源码安装，源码位于镜像根目录 ``/`` 下。\n"
"* 推理后端为 ``SGLang`` 镜像中，SGLang、MindSpeed、verl 为源码安装，源码位于镜像根目录 ``/`` 下。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"* In the image with the ``vLLM`` inference backend, vLLM, vLLM-ascend, MindSpeed, Megatron-LM, and verl are installed from source. The source code is located in the root directory ``/`` of the image.\n"
"* In the image with the ``SGLang`` inference backend, SGLang, MindSpeed, and verl are installed from source. The source code is located in the root directory ``/`` of the image.\n"
""

