msgid ""
"* 以 vLLM 的镜像为例，``Dockerfile.ascend_9.1.0_a2`` 为 Dockerfile 文件名，``verl-ascend:9.1.0-a2`` 中，verl-ascend 为自定义的镜像名称，9.1.0-a2 为自定义的镜像标签\n"
"* 构建 verl v0.9.1 镜像时，请使用带 ``_v0.9.1`` 后缀的 Dockerfile；A3 和 950PR&950DT 分别使用清单中对应的 ``a3`` 和 ``a5`` 文件。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"* Using the vLLM image as an example, ``Dockerfile.ascend_9.1.0_a2`` is the Dockerfile name. In ``verl-ascend:9.1.0-a2``, verl-ascend is the custom image name, and 9.1.0-a2 is the custom image tag.\n"
"* When building the verl v0.9.1 image, use the Dockerfile with the ``_v0.9.1`` suffix. For A3 and 950PR&950DT, use the corresponding ``a3`` and ``a5`` files in the list, respectively.\n"
""

msgid ""
"容器启动命令模板\n"
"----------------\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Container startup command template\n"
"---------------------------------\n"
""

msgid ""
"* 如需挂载其他本地路径到容器，请自行添加 ``-v <宿主机路径>:<容器内路径>``\n"
"* 建议将 ``{your_docker_name}`` 替换为具有实际意义的容器名称\n"
"* ``--privileged`` 参数授予容器扩展权限，请根据实际安全需求评估是否必要\n"
"* ``{image_name}:{tag}`` 请换成容器构建时对应的镜像名称与标签\n"
""
msgstr ""
"* If you need to mount other local paths to the container, add ``-v <host machine path>:<path inside the container>``\n"
"* Replace ``{your_docker_name}`` with a meaningful container name\n"
"* The ``--privileged`` parameter grants extended permissions to the container. Evaluate whether it is necessary based on your actual security requirements.\n"
"* Replace ``{image_name}:{tag}`` with the corresponding image name and tag used when building the container\n"
""

